\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces End-to-end architecture and optimization workflow of POLARIS. Base word embeddings on $\mathbb  {S}^{99}$ pass through three sequential Householder-reflected spherical layers with decreasing directional concentration ($\kappa ^{(1)} > \kappa ^{(2)} > \kappa ^{(3)}$). Layer 2 feeds lexical polarity representations and bipolar salience to sentiment document readout ($\mathbf  {d}_{\text  {rt}}$), whereas Layer 3 provides topic-transported representations for multi-class document clustering and classification ($\mathbf  {d}_{\text  {ng}}$).}}{4}{}\protected@file@percent }
